1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
مَنْ لَا يَشْكُرِ النَّاسَ لَا يَشْكُرِ اللَّهَ

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,540
That's what the Prophet ﷺ said.

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,700
Whoever doesn't thank the people,

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:09,940
doesn't thank Allah سُبْحَانَهُ وَتَعَالَى.

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,020
So how do you teach your children to thank you?

6
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:15,200
First, let them hear it from us.

7
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,200
When your child brings something,

8
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,720
say “thank you.”

9
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,040
When they help you,

10
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,460
say “thank you for helping me.”

11
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:24,360
Children learn a lot from what they see us do.

12
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,260
Then teach them to notice

13
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,140
when someone makes something kind for them.

14
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,560
Mum made your food?

15
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,780
Say “thank you.”

16
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:31,900
Dad helped you?

17
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:32,960
Say “thank you.”

18
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,200
And remind them, when you thank the people

19
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,160
for something good they do for you,

20
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,600
Allah سُبْحَانَهُ وَتَعَالَى

21
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:39,640
loves that from you,

22
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:41,240
and you are rewarded for

23
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,140
doing what the Prophet

24
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,400
صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّمَ

25
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:44,300
taught us to do.

26
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,300
So today, don't just ask

27
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,760
your child to say “thank you.”

28
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,920
Say it to them first.
